title: The Sun Says
tags: event
view-if: in_campaign = 1 and tabloid_support >= 1 and months_to_election <= 1
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
on-arrival: c2_con += 3*(1-dissent); de_con += 2*(1-dissent)

= The Sun Says

The Sun, the country's best-selling newspaper and read by millions of Labour voters, lets it be known that its polling-day front page will tell them to "vote Tory this time".
